<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .header h2 {
            color: #3266CC;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .content {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .temporary-password {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #3266CC;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: #669900;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999999;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .warning {
            color: #d9534f;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Abittoenergy Logo" style="max-width: 200px; height: auto;" />
        </div>
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Welcome to Abittoenergy!</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
            <p>An administrator has created an account for you at Abittoenergy. You can now log in to manage your gas supply and monitor your usage.</p>
            
            <p>Your login credentials are:</p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> {{email}}</p>
            <div class="temporary-password">
                {{temporaryPassword}}
            </div>
            
            <p class="warning">IMPORTANT: This is a temporary password. For security reasons, please log in and update your password immediately.</p>
            
            <div class="button-container">
                <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="button">Log In and Update Password</a>
            </div>
            
            <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, our support team is ready to help.</p>
            
            <p>Stay energized,<br>The Abittoenergy Team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Abittoenergy. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
